{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f8e7d6c5-b4a3-2918-7654-3210fedcba98",
    "name": "Atur Perjalanan API",
    "description": "REST API collection for Atur Perjalanan backend (NestJS).\n\n**Milestone coverage:** M3 — Health, Auth, Users\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection and `atur-perjalanan-local.postman_environment.json`\n2. Select the **Atur Perjalanan — Local** environment\n3. Set `google_id_token` in the environment (from Google Sign-In on mobile/web)\n4. Run **Auth → Google Sign-In** — test script saves `access_token` automatically\n5. For new users, run **Complete Registration** before other authenticated requests\n\n## Variables\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `base_url` | API base URL (default `http://localhost:8080/v1`) |\n| `google_id_token` | Google OAuth ID token for `POST /auth/google` |\n| `access_token` | App JWT (auto-saved after sign-in) |\n| `realtime_token` | Supabase-compatible JWT for Realtime |\n| `username` | Username for profile/trips requests |\n\n## Error format\n```json\n{ \"error\": { \"code\": \"ERROR_CODE\", \"message\": \"...\" }, \"requestId\": \"...\" }\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Collection-level pre-request hook (extend per milestone as needed)"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "realtime_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "johndoe"
    },
    {
      "key": "google_id_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "search_query",
      "value": "john"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Infrastructure health check (M2/M3). No authentication required.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Returns server health status.\n\n**Response 200:**\n```json\n{ \"status\": \"ok\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-12T12:00:00.000Z\" }\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Google Sign-In and username onboarding (M3).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Google Sign-In",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.access_token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (body.realtime_token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('realtime_token', body.realtime_token);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('realtime_token', body.realtime_token);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (body.user && body.user.username) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('username', body.user.username);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('username', body.user.username);",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 or 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has access_token', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('access_token');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('is_new_user');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id_token\": \"{{google_id_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/google",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "google"]
            },
            "description": "Verify Google ID token and sign in / register user.\n\n**Auth:** None (public)\n\n**Body:**\n- `id_token` (string, required) — Google OAuth ID token\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"access_token\": \"...\",\n  \"realtime_token\": \"...\",\n  \"is_new_user\": false,\n  \"user\": { \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"username\": \"...\", ... }\n}\n```\n\n`user` is omitted when `is_new_user` is `true` — call **Complete Registration** next.\n\n**Errors:** `401` invalid Google token"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete Registration",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.user && body.user.username) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('username', body.user.username);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('username', body.user.username);",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 or 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has user profile', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('user');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.user).to.have.property('username');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/complete-registration",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "complete-registration"]
            },
            "description": "Set username for a newly registered user.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer JWT (required)\n\n**Body:**\n- `username` (string, required) — 3–30 chars, `[a-zA-Z0-9_]+`\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{ \"user\": { \"id\": \"...\", \"username\": \"...\", ... } }\n```\n\n**Errors:** `409 USERNAME_TAKEN`, `400 USERNAME_INVALID`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "User profile, search, and public profile endpoints (M3).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Check Username",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/check-username?username={{username}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "check-username"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{username}}",
                  "description": "3–30 chars, letters/numbers/underscore"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Check if a username is available (real-time validation during onboarding).\n\n**Auth:** None (public)\n\n**Query:**\n- `username` (required)\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{ \"username\": \"johndoe\", \"available\": true }\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/search?q={{search_query}}&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "search"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "{{search_query}}",
                  "description": "Search query (min 1 char)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "cursor",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "UUID cursor for pagination",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "Page size (default 20, max 100)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Search users by name or username (pg_trgm).\n\n**Auth:** Bearer JWT (required)\n\n**Query:**\n- `q` (required, min 1 char)\n- `cursor` (optional, UUID)\n- `limit` (optional, default 20, max 100)\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": [{ \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"username\": \"...\", \"avatar_url\": null, \"trip_count\": 0 }],\n  \"next_cursor\": null\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Get the authenticated user's profile.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer JWT (required)\n\n**Response:** `UserProfile`\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"...\",\n  \"name\": \"...\",\n  \"username\": \"...\",\n  \"avatar_url\": null,\n  \"bio\": null,\n  \"website_url\": null,\n  \"location_label\": null,\n  \"is_public\": true,\n  \"trip_count\": 0,\n  \"created_at\": \"...\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"bio\": \"Travel enthusiast from Jakarta\",\n  \"website_url\": \"https://example.com\",\n  \"location_label\": \"Jakarta, Indonesia\",\n  \"is_public\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Update the authenticated user's profile.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer JWT (required)\n\n**Body (all optional):**\n- `bio` (string, max 150)\n- `website_url` (valid URL, max 255)\n- `location_label` (string, max 100)\n- `is_public` (boolean)\n\n**Response:** Updated `UserProfile`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Permanently delete the authenticated user's account.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer JWT (required)\n\n**Response:** `204 No Content` (empty body)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Profile by Username",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/{{username}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{username}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get a user's public profile by username.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer JWT (required)\n\n**Path:**\n- `username` (string)\n\n**Response:** `UserProfile`\n\n**Errors:**\n- `404 USER_NOT_FOUND`\n- `403 PROFILE_PRIVATE` (private profile, viewer is not owner)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User Trips",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/{{username}}/trips?limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["users", "{{username}}", "trips"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "cursor",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Trip UUID cursor",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "Page size (default 20, max 100)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "List trips for a user (privacy-aware).\n\n**Auth:** Bearer JWT (required)\n\n**Path:**\n- `username` (string)\n\n**Query:**\n- `cursor` (optional, trip UUID)\n- `limit` (optional, default 20, max 100)\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": [{ \"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"status\": \"fixed\", ... }],\n  \"next_cursor\": null\n}\n```\n\nOwner sees all trips; non-owner sees only `is_public: true` trips.\n\n**Errors:** `404 USER_NOT_FOUND`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
